<title>SWEDEN: Industrivarden '96 profit falls 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Industrivarden '96 profit falls 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish holding company Industrivarden presented these 1996 earnings on Tuesday.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		  1,417 vs 1,765</p>
<p> Net Asset Value/share Feb 28 (crowns) 501 vs n/a</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (crowns)		 13 vs 11</p>
<p> Sales					 5,547 vs 5,893</p>
<p> Costs					 4,973 vs 5,187</p>
<p> One-off items				   0 vs 1,195</p>
<p> Depreciation				  205 vs 218</p>
<p> Operating profit			    369 vs 1,683</p>
<p> Dividends received			  490 vs 254</p>
<p> Gains from shares sold		    679 vs 86</p>
<p> Minorities					0 vs 1</p>
<p>CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax						58 vs 29  Net profit</p>
<p>			    1,286 vs 1,615</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
